   * check is actually executed by continuing the method chain. For example:
   *
   * <pre>{@code
   * assertThat(actualMap)
   *   .comparingValuesUsing(correspondence)
   *   .containsEntry(expectedKey, expectedValue);
   * }</pre>
   *
